1104
01:17:13.695 --> 01:17:15.416
Stay away from each other!

1105
01:17:15.777 --> 01:17:17.979
You got food on it!

1106
01:17:18.219 --> 01:17:22.423
203 volunteer hours.
Wow, that's a lot.

1107
01:17:22.984 --> 01:17:25.266
Have you read this volunteer report?

1108
01:17:25.386 --> 01:17:26.307
No,

1109
