1259
01:32:53.034 --> 01:32:56.197
Cheer for him on my
behalf. I'm hanging up.

1260
01:32:56.357 --> 01:32:58.199
Don't hang up! Don't!

1261
01:32:58.479 --> 01:32:59.520
Hey!

1262
