1281
01:35:59.460 --> 01:36:02.343
Get to Geumcheon pool right away.

1282
01:36:04.145 --> 01:36:05.627
Dummy, Dung-gu, Dong-gu, swim!

1283
01:36:05.747 --> 01:36:08.269
Dummy, Dung-gu,
Dong-gu, you're the best!

1284
