1285
01:36:19.440 --> 01:36:21.963
Dong-gu, you asshole! Do your best!

1286
01:36:32.734 --> 01:36:33.855
Dong-gu.

1287
01:36:34.896 --> 01:36:35.897
Dong-gu!

1288
01:36:37.058 --> 01:36:38.740
